# NOTE: We intentionally do NOT ignore the 'nodered/' folder here, because
# this Dockerfile needs to COPY nodered/flows_das_LINE-XX.json from the
# build context. The repo-root .dockerignore (used by the main equip-sim
# python image build) excludes 'nodered/' but BuildKit picks up this
# per-Dockerfile ignore file when building Dockerfile.nodered.
